  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Ushkam Santosh vs The State Of Telangana on 11 November, 2020 Author: K. Lakshman Bench: K. Lakshman Honourable Sri Justice K. Lakshman",
    "facts": "This application is filed under Section 482 Cr.P.C. to quash the proceedings in Crime No.238 of 2019 of Adilabad - I Town Police Station, Adilabad District, against petitioners. The petitioners are Accused Nos.1 to 3 in the said Crime. The offences alleged against them are under Sections - 270, 272, 273, 420 and 336 of IPC. 2.",
    "arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioners as well as the learned Assistant Public Prosecutor would submit that the subject matter is squarely covered by a common order dated 27.08.2018, passed by the High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the States of Telangana and Andhra Pradesh in Crl.P. No.3731 of 2018 and batch, and placed copy of the said judgment for perusal.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "The learned counsel for the petitioners as well as the learned Assistant Public Prosecutor would submit that the subject matter is squarely covered by a common order dated 27.08.2018, passed by the High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the States of Telangana and Andhra Pradesh in Crl.P. No.3731 of 2018 and batch, and placed copy of the said judgment for perusal.",
